# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF line endings, whatever core.autocrlf
# says on the machine that clones this repository. The tool writes LF on every platform,
# and the committed samples are compared with its output byte for byte, by the README's
# quickstart and by the test suite, so a checkout that turned them into CRLF would fail
# both on a tree nobody had changed.
* text=auto eol=lf
